+### 3a. Suggest (dispatch)
+
+When action is `suggest` or `fan-resolve`, dispatch the suggestion-conductor as a subagent:
+
+```
+Agent(
+  subagent_type: "suggestion-conductor"
+  prompt: "Run Pass 1. The routing plan is at tomo-tmp/routing-plan.json. Follow your workflow exactly."
+)
+```
+
+Output the suggestion-conductor's report to the user, then exit.
